    "description": {
      "type": "doc",
      "version": 1,
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "heading",
          "attrs": {
            "level": 2
          },
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "User story"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "As a GIS user, I want to recover from a catalogue search that finds nothing so I can find Surveyor and continue using the map."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "heading",
          "attrs": {
            "level": 2
          },
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Scope and setup"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Start at https://o2intelligence-v4-dev.metricell.com/launcher using authorised V4 access. Use only normal UI controls. Open GIS and wait for the map/catalogue to settle. With Search layers empty, record the unfiltered catalogue, map view and complete existing Map layers list/order. An absent Map layers list is a valid baseline. Do not add/remove layers, zoom/pan the map or change saved settings. Use Search layers, not Search Map."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "heading",
          "attrs": {
            "level": 2
          },
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Acceptance criteria"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "orderedList",
          "attrs": {
            "order": 1
          },
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "listItem",
              "content": [
                {
                  "type": "paragraph",
                  "content": [
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "text": "Enter zzqa_showcase_no_match_20261012 into Search layers. The entered text remains visible and no matching catalogue entries are shown; the GIS map remains available. No particular no-results wording is required."
                    }
                  ]
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "listItem",
              "content": [
                {
                  "type": "paragraph",
                  "content": [
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "text": "Replace the no-match text with Surveyor without reloading GIS. Surveyor appears in the filtered catalogue and the map remains available."
                    }
                  ]
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "listItem",
              "content": [
                {
                  "type": "paragraph",
                  "content": [
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "text": "Clear Search layers. The original catalogue returns, and the complete Map layers entries/order and map view match the recorded pre-search baseline, without an added or removed layer."
                    }
                  ]
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "heading",
          "attrs": {
            "level": 2
          },
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Evidence and cleanup"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Capture this criterion's own original baseline and decisive no-match/recovery/restored states. For unchanged-state comparisons, show unobscured original and restored map/layer lists. Record the actual browser URL at each final assertion. Leave the search empty and preserve all pre-existing state."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "heading",
          "attrs": {
            "level": 2
          },
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "User-guide relevance"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Assess existing search-recovery guidance; amend only a verified material gap and avoid duplicate instructions."
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
